"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div><header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6.5 3.5h11v17l-5.5-3.8-5.5 3.8z\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 8h5M9.5 11h5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Anhang</div><h1>암기 노트</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Das Wichtigste zum Auswendiglernen</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">1과부터 37과까지 나온 변화표와 목록 가운데 외워 두어야 할 것만 골라 주제별로 모았어요.<br>제목 옆의 과 번호를 누르면 그 과로 가서 설명을 다시 볼 수 있어요.<nav class=\"ax-toc\" id=\"ax-toc\" aria-label=\"부록 차례\"><div class=\"ax-toc-t\">차례</div><ol><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-1\"><b>1</b><span>명사</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-2\"><b>2</b><span>관사</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-3\"><b>3</b><span>대명사</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-4\"><b>4</b><span>동사 활용</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-5\"><b>5</b><span>시제 · 수동 · 접속법</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-6\"><b>6</b><span>동사와 함께 쓰는 말</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-7\"><b>7</b><span>형용사</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-8\"><b>8</b><span>전치사</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-9\"><b>9</b><span>접속사와 연결어</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-10\"><b>10</b><span>어순과 부정</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-11\"><b>11</b><span>말투와 추측</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-12\"><b>12</b><span>수와 시간</span></a></li></ol></nav></div></header><section id=\"ax-1\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">1</span><h2>명사<span class=\"ax-de\">Nomen</span></h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge\">모양이 같은 ein</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">남성과 중성은 부정관사가 둘 다 ein이에요.<br/>ein만 보고는 남성인지 중성인지 알 수 없어요. 그래서 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span>는 정관사와 함께 외워요.</p></div></div><h3>여성 명사의 단서<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L01\" aria-label=\"Lektion 01로 가기\">1과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>끝</th><th>예</th><th>확실성</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>-ung</td><td>die Zeitung 신문 · die Wohnung 집</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-heit · -keit</td><td>die Freiheit 자유 · die Möglichkeit 가능성</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-schaft</td><td>die Freundschaft 우정 · die Mannschaft 팀</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-ion</td><td>die Information 정보 · die Lektion 과</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-tät</td><td>die Universität 대학교 · die Qualität 품질</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-ei</td><td>die Bäckerei 빵집 · die Polizei 경찰</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-in (사람)</td><td>die Lehrerin 여교사 · die Freundin 여자 친구</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-ie · -ik · -ur</td><td>die Familie 가족 · die Musik 음악 · die Kultur 문화</td><td>○</td></tr><tr><td>-e</td><td>die Lampe 램프 · die Straße 거리 · die Tasche 가방</td><td>○ 약 90%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>남성 명사의 단서<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L01\" aria-label=\"Lektion 01로 가기\">1과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>끝·뜻</th><th>예</th><th>확실성</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>-ling</td><td>der Frühling 봄 · der Schmetterling 나비</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-ismus</td><td>der Tourismus 관광 · der Realismus 사실주의</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-ent · -ant · -ist (사람)</td><td>der Student · der Praktikant · der Polizist</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>요일·달·계절</td><td>der Montag · der Mai · der Sommer</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-er (사람·기계)</td><td>der Lehrer 교사 · der Computer 컴퓨터</td><td>○</td></tr><tr><td>-ig · -or</td><td>der Honig 꿀 · der Motor 모터 · der Doktor 박사</td><td>○</td></tr><tr><td>방위·날씨</td><td>der Norden 북쪽 · der Regen 비 · der Schnee 눈</td><td>○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>중성 명사의 단서<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L01\" aria-label=\"Lektion 01로 가기\">1과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>끝·뜻</th><th>예</th><th>확실성</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>-chen · -lein (작은 것)</td><td>das Mädchen 소녀 · das Brötchen 작은 빵 · das Häuschen 작은 집</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>동사원형을 명사로</td><td>das Essen 음식 · das Leben 삶 · das Schwimmen 수영</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>색·언어 이름</td><td>das Rot 빨강 · das Deutsch 독일어</td><td>●</td></tr><tr><td>-um</td><td>das Museum 박물관 · das Zentrum 중심 · das Datum 날짜</td><td>○</td></tr><tr><td>-ment</td><td>das Dokument 문서 · das Medikament 약</td><td>○</td></tr><tr><td>-nis</td><td>das Ergebnis 결과 · das Zeugnis 성적표</td><td>○</td></tr><tr><td>Ge-로 시작</td><td>das Gemüse 채소 · das Gebäude 건물 · das Getränk 음료</td><td>○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>사람 명사의 여성형 -in<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L01\" aria-label=\"Lektion 01로 가기\">1과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th class=\"gm\">남성</th><th class=\"gf\">여성</th><th>뜻</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>der Lehrer</td><td>die Lehrer<span class=\"x-e\">in</span></td><td>교사</td></tr><tr><td>der Student</td><td>die Student<span class=\"x-e\">in</span></td><td>대학생</td></tr><tr><td>der Koreaner</td><td>die Koreaner<span class=\"x-e\">in</span></td><td>한국인</td></tr><tr><td>der Freund</td><td>die Freund<span class=\"x-e\">in</span></td><td>친구</td></tr><tr><td>der Arzt</td><td>die Ärzt<span class=\"x-e\">in</span></td><td>의사</td></tr><tr><td>der Koch</td><td>die Köch<span class=\"x-e\">in</span></td><td>요리사</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>복수형 다섯 가지<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L02\" aria-label=\"Lektion 02로 가기\">2과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>유형</th><th>어미</th><th>예</th><th>주로 어떤 명사</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>①</td><td>-e / ¨-e</td><td>der Tag → die Tag<span class=\"x-e\">e</span><br/>der Stuhl → die St<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>hl<span class=\"x-e\">e</span></td><td>남성 대부분, 일부 중성</td></tr><tr><td>②</td><td>-n / -en</td><td>die Lampe → die Lampe<span class=\"x-e\">n</span><br/>die Frau → die Frau<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td><td>여성 대부분</td></tr><tr><td>③</td><td>-er / ¨-er</td><td>das Kind → die Kind<span class=\"x-e\">er</span><br/>das Buch → die B<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>ch<span class=\"x-e\">er</span></td><td>1음절 중성</td></tr><tr><td>④</td><td>-s</td><td>das Auto → die Auto<span class=\"x-e\">s</span><br/>das Hotel → die Hotel<span class=\"x-e\">s</span></td><td>외래어, 모음으로 끝나는 말</td></tr><tr><td>⑤</td><td>- / ¨-</td><td>der Lehrer → die Lehrer<br/>die Mutter → die M<span class=\"x-e\">ü</span>tter</td><td>-er·-el·-en으로 끝나는 말</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>복수형과 움라우트<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L02\" aria-label=\"Lektion 02로 가기\">2과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>유형</th><th>움라우트</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>① -e</td><td>자주</td><td>der Zug → die Züge · der Baum → die Bäume</td></tr><tr><td>③ -er</td><td>바꿀 모음이 있으면 늘</td><td>das Haus → die Häuser · der Mann → die Männer</td></tr><tr><td>⑤ 변화 없음</td><td>가끔</td><td>der Vater → die Väter · der Apfel → die Äpfel</td></tr><tr><td>② -(e)n</td><td>없음</td><td>die Frau → die Frauen</td></tr><tr><td>④ -s</td><td>없음</td><td>das Auto → die Autos</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>복수만 쓰는 명사<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L02\" aria-label=\"Lektion 02로 가기\">2과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>명사</th><th>뜻</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>die Leute</td><td>사람들</td></tr><tr><td>die Eltern</td><td>부모</td></tr><tr><td>die Geschwister</td><td>형제자매</td></tr><tr><td>die Großeltern</td><td>조부모</td></tr><tr><td>die Ferien</td><td>(학교) 방학</td></tr><tr><td>die Kosten</td><td>비용</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>2격 명사 어미<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L16\" aria-label=\"Lektion 16로 가기\">16과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>명사 끝</th><th>어미</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2음절 이상</td><td>-s</td><td>des Lehrer<span class=\"x-e\">s</span> · des Computer<span class=\"x-e\">s</span> · des Zimmer<span class=\"x-e\">s</span> · des Museum<span class=\"x-e\">s</span></td></tr><tr><td>1음절</td><td>주로 -es (-s도 가능)</td><td>des Mann<span class=\"x-e\">es</span> · des Tag<span class=\"x-e\">es</span> · des Buch<span class=\"x-e\">es</span></td></tr><tr><td>-s · -ß · -x · -z</td><td>반드시 -es</td><td>des Haus<span class=\"x-e\">es</span> · des Fuß<span class=\"x-e\">es</span> · des Platz<span class=\"x-e\">es</span></td></tr><tr><td>여성 · 복수</td><td>없음</td><td>der Frau · der Kinder</td></tr><tr><td>n-변화 남성</td><td>-(e)n</td><td>des Student<span class=\"x-e\">en</span> · des Junge<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>n-변화 명사<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L16\" aria-label=\"Lektion 16로 가기\">16과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>무리</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>-e로 끝나는 사람·동물 (남성)</td><td>der Junge 소년 · der Kollege 동료 · der Kunde 고객 · der Neffe 조카 · der Franzose 프랑스인 · der Löwe 사자 · der Affe 원숭이</td></tr><tr><td>-ent · -ant · -ist · -at · -oge (외래어 사람)</td><td>der Student · der Präsident · der Praktikant · der Polizist · der Journalist · der Soldat · der Biologe</td></tr><tr><td>그 밖의 몇 개</td><td>der Mensch 사람 · der Herr 신사·~⁠씨 · der Nachbar 이웃 · der Bär 곰 · der Held 영웅</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"decl-m ax-lab\"><thead><tr><th>격</th><th>der Student</th><th>der Junge</th><th>der Herr</th><th>der Mensch</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rh\">1격</td><td data-g=\"der Student\">der Student</td><td data-g=\"der Junge\">der Junge</td><td data-g=\"der Herr\">der Herr</td><td data-g=\"der Mensch\">der Mensch</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">2격</td><td data-g=\"der Student\">des Student<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td><td data-g=\"der Junge\">des Junge<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td><td data-g=\"der Herr\">des Herr<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td><td data-g=\"der Mensch\">des Mensch<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">3격</td><td data-g=\"der Student\">dem Student<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td><td data-g=\"der Junge\">dem Junge<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td><td data-g=\"der Herr\">dem Herr<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td><td data-g=\"der Mensch\">dem Mensch<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">4격</td><td data-g=\"der Student\">den Student<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td><td data-g=\"der Junge\">den Junge<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td><td data-g=\"der Herr\">den Herr<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td><td data-g=\"der Mensch\">den Mensch<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">복수</td><td data-g=\"der Student\">die Studenten</td><td data-g=\"der Junge\">die Jungen</td><td data-g=\"der Herr\">die Herr<span class=\"x-e\">en</span></td><td data-g=\"der Mensch\">die Menschen</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge\">사전에서 알아보기</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">n-변화 명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">n-변화 명사</span>1격을 뺀 모든 자리에서 끝에 -(e)n이 붙는 일부 남성 명사예요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Student → den Studenten · dem Studenten</span></span></span>는 사전에 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">2격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">2격</span>'~의'를 나타내는 자리예요. 다른 명사 뒤에서 누구·무엇의 것인지 나타내요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: das Auto des Mannes 그 남자의 차</span></span></span>이 -(e)n으로 나와요 — Student m. -en, -en · Junge m. -n, -n.<br/>보통 남성 명사는 2격이 -(e)s예요 — Tisch m. -(e)s, -e.</p></div></div><h3>동사에서 만든 명사<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L35\" aria-label=\"Lektion 35로 가기\">35과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>만드는 법</th><th>예</th><th>성</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>어간 + <strong>-ung</strong></td><td>wohnen → die Wohnung · bestellen → die Bestellung · entscheiden → die Entscheidung</td><td>늘 여성</td></tr><tr><td>원형 그대로 — 동작 자체</td><td>essen → das Essen · lesen → das Lesen · schwimmen → das Schwimmen</td><td>늘 중성</td></tr><tr><td>어간만 — 모음이 바뀌기도</td><td>anfangen → der Anfang · besuchen → der Besuch · kaufen → der Kauf · schlafen → der Schlaf</td><td>대부분 남성</td></tr><tr><td>모양이 많이 바뀌는 것 — 외우기</td><td>ankommen → die Ankunft · fahren → die Fahrt · abfahren → die Abfahrt</td><td>여성(-t)</td></tr><tr><td>어간 + <strong>-er</strong> — 하는 사람</td><td>lehren → der Lehrer · fahren → der Fahrer · spielen → der Spieler</td><td>남성, 여성은 -in</td></tr><tr><td>어간 + <strong>-er</strong> — 도구</td><td>wecken → der Wecker · rechnen → der Rechner</td><td>남성</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>형용사에서 만든 명사<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L35\" aria-label=\"Lektion 35로 가기\">35과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>만드는 법</th><th>예</th><th>성</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>-heit</strong></td><td>frei → die Freiheit · gesund → die Gesundheit · krank → die Krankheit · schön → die Schönheit</td><td>여성</td></tr><tr><td><strong>-keit</strong> — -ig · -lich · -bar · -sam 뒤</td><td>möglich → die Möglichkeit · schwierig → die Schwierigkeit · ehrlich → die Ehrlichkeit</td><td>여성</td></tr><tr><td><strong>-e</strong> + 움라우트</td><td>groß → die Größe · warm → die Wärme · lang → die Länge · kalt → die Kälte</td><td>여성</td></tr><tr><td>형용사를 명사로(24과)</td><td>der/die Deutsche · das Gute</td><td>뜻에 따라</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge\">-heit냐 -keit냐</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">형용사가 -ig · -lich · -bar · -sam으로 끝나면 -keit, 그 밖에는 대개 -heit예요.<br/>schwierig → Schwierig<strong>keit</strong> · freundlich → Freundlich<strong>keit</strong> / frei → Frei<strong>heit</strong> · sicher → Sicher<strong>heit</strong></p></div></div><p class=\"ax-up\" data-no-print><a href=\"#/anhang\" data-jump=\"ax-toc\">차례로 ↑</a></p></section><section id=\"ax-2\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">2</span><h2>관사<span class=\"ax-de\">Artikel</span></h2></div><h3>정관사의 변화<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L03\" aria-label=\"Lektion 03로 가기\">3과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"decl-m\"><thead><tr><th>격</th><th class=\"gm\">m</th><th class=\"gf\">f</th><th class=\"gn\">n</th><th>pl</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rh\">1격 ~⁠이/가</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>der</strong> Mann</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>die</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>das</strong> Kind</td><td data-g=\"pl\"><strong>die</strong> Kinder</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">2격 ~⁠의</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>des</strong> Mann<span class=\"x-e\">es</span></td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>der</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>des</strong> Kind<span class=\"x-e\">es</span></td><td data-g=\"pl\"><strong>der</strong> Kinder</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">3격 ~⁠에게</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>dem</strong> Mann</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>der</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>dem</strong> Kind</td><td data-g=\"pl\"><strong>den</strong> Kinder<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">4격 ~⁠을/를</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>den</strong> Mann</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>die</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>das</strong> Kind</td><td data-g=\"pl\"><strong>die</strong> Kinder</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>정관사의 끝글자<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L03\" aria-label=\"Lektion 03로 가기\">3과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"decl-m\"><thead><tr><th>격</th><th class=\"gm\">m</th><th class=\"gf\">f</th><th class=\"gn\">n</th><th>pl</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rh\">1격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\">-r</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\">-e</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\">-s</td><td data-g=\"pl\">-e</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">2격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\">-s</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\">-r</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\">-s</td><td data-g=\"pl\">-r</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">3격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\">-m</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\">-r</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\">-m</td><td data-g=\"pl\">-n</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">4격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\">-n</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\">-e</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\">-s</td><td data-g=\"pl\">-e</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>부정관사의 변화<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L03\" aria-label=\"Lektion 03로 가기\">3과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"decl-m\"><thead><tr><th>격</th><th class=\"gm\">m</th><th class=\"gf\">f</th><th class=\"gn\">n</th><th>pl</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"rh\">1격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>ein</strong> Mann</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>eine</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>ein</strong> Kind</td><td data-g=\"pl\">Kinder</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">2격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>eines</strong> Mann<span class=\"x-e\">es</span></td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>einer</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>eines</strong> Kind<span class=\"x-e\">es</span></td><td data-g=\"pl\">(von Kindern)</td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">3격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>einem</strong> Mann</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>einer</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>einem</strong> Kind</td><td data-g=\"pl\">Kinder<span class=\"x-e\">n</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"rh\">4격</td><td class=\"gm\" data-g=\"m\"><strong>einen</strong> Mann</td><td class=\"gf\" data-g=\"f\"><strong>eine</strong> Frau</td><td class=\"gn\" data-g=\"n\"><strong>ein</strong> Kind</td><td data-g=\"pl\">Kinder</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>소유관사 — 누구의 것인지<a class=\"ax-src\" href=\"#/L08\" aria-label=\"Lektion 08로 가기\">8과</a></h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-first\"><thead><tr><th>인칭대명사</th><th>소유관사</th><th>뜻</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ich</t